BT /F1 12 Tf 14 TL 72 720 Td (Novellia Wellness Council Community Brief) Tj T* () Tj T* (Overview) Tj T* (The Novellia Wellness Program has operated in the fictitious town of Alder Brook for twelve years. Public attendance logs show between forty and sixty participants at each seasonal orientation session. This descriptive summary is supported by the program schedule printed in Section 2 of this brief.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Outcome Claims) Tj T* (The program causes participants to live longer than non-participants. This brief does not include controlled comparisons, medical records, or follow-up data.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Promotional Language) Tj T* (Participants often feel transformed by the experience and describe a uniquely holistic path to vitality.) Tj ET
